{"1893440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INTO EVIL", "steam_appid": 1893440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.poster.avif?t=1787708238\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.webm?t=1787708238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.mp4?t=1787708238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEEL THYSELF, AND DESCEND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The servants of T̴̨̈́h̴̛͉e̷̦͌ ̷̡́I̷̫̐ń̵̦v̸̢̈́e̷͇͐r̷̩͋ẗ̷͈́ḛ̸̽d̵̬̆ ̵̀ͅT̶̖̈́o̵͎͋w̶̹̾e̸͎͊r̷̬͝  venture forth each night, dragging the meek and fearful from their homes down into the Tower's abyssal depths, never to return. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to <strong>you</strong> to brave the dangers beneath the earth. Up to you to slay those behind the horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To descend ever deeper... INTO EVIL. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/baff2c42e761ca81b64a98d7381fe68a.avif?t=1787708238\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just bundles of stats, every item in INTO EVIL is unique and <strong>actually</strong> changes the way you play. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movesets:</strong> Swords parry, axes cleave, lanterns still shine when stowed - <i>every</i> item has two moves (and often hidden secrets!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchantments and Curses:</strong> Find items <strong>imbued with dark magic</strong> that radically changes their properties! Infused spells, elemental affinities, mutations, and more - expect the unexpected. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities, not stats:</strong> No &quot;+2% fire resist&quot; here - rather than small stat increments, weapons and armor unlock new abilities and powers to face your enemies with. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/2d117a6c830c803f13bab69c0bae2893.avif?t=1787708238\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure that awaits you is deadly and unpredictable - no matter how many times you face it. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected dangers:</strong> The dungeons of the T̴̨̈́h̴̛͉e̷̦͌ ̷̡́I̷̫̐ń̵̦v̸̢̈́e̷͇͐r̷̩͋ẗ̷͈́ḛ̸̽d̵̬̆ ̵̀ͅT̶̖̈́o̵͎͋w̶̹̾e̸͎͊r̷̬͝ are labyrinthine and cursed, <strong>changing their layout</strong> each time you attempt to brave them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices:</strong> Not only are items powerful, they are <i>scarce</i> and you can only take what you can carry. Foes, traps, and hazards shift each time you die - but your <strong>choices</strong> will shape each Descent as well. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die, die again:</strong> INTO EVIL is difficult - every enemy is a significant threat and cannot be taken lightly. You will need to learn to adapt to the dangers that confront you, or you will perish brutally. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/3618a5e2b2242940c0666a3c123df2d2.avif?t=1787708238\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a world gone mad - devils and death, torture and madness await. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Hordes of Hell:</strong> Demons infest the dungeons of INTO EVIL, wielding terrible supernatural powers. You will need every ounce of skill and courage you can muster in order to survive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes turned betrayers:</strong> The T̴̨̈́h̴̛͉e̷̦͌ ̷̡́I̷̫̐ń̵̦v̸̢̈́e̷͇͐r̷̩͋ẗ̷͈́ḛ̸̽d̵̬̆ ̵̀ͅT̶̖̈́o̵͎͋w̶̹̾e̸͎͊r̷̬͝ has been taken over by former heroes who now side with evil. What caused this turn? What dark purpose possesses them? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark secrets await:</strong> Learn tḧ̶͉́e̴̢͂ t̶̼̂e̴̙͑r̶͕͘r̶͚͉̈́ḯ̷͕b̶̻͖͛l̸̜̈e̷̜͗ ̵̛͓̒ t̵̰̜͝ṟ̶̪̈́̚u̸̪͔̾͘t̶̟̀͜h̶̺̓̈,̵͎̍̓ ̸̧̍t̴̢̛̤͛h̴͉͎̅a̴͍̖͗̍t̸̨̺͐̅█̸̢̀͝█̵̼́ ̸̛̬̗͝█̸̻̩͘ ̶̡̙̅█̷̣͎̅█̶̹͒█̸̪̾͂ ̶̨̯̓█̵͚͐̚█̴̭̞̏͠ ̴̦̅█̴̢̘͒█̸̭̅█̷̥̀█̵̢͝█̵̲̗̔͊█̴̞̳͑͛█̷̫͍͂█̶̬͔͒█̴̡̤̒́█̶̛̬ͅ █̷͓̎͗͜█̴͔͚́̀█̵̬̹̍̈́█̸̜̔█̸͍̐ █̸̦͎̈█̵̗̓͘█̴͚̌͜█̶̬̪̑̀█̷͓̳͂█̴̗̮͑ █̴̢͔̿͠█̸̞̙̊█̶̹̻̂█̶͙̔̀█̵̟̹̂̐█̷̰̳̈́̎█̵̧̱͒█̷̖̗̐̂█̷̜̯̓̑ █̶̢̩͐̔█̶̬̍̆█̷͎̤̅͌█̷͔͠ █̴̨̺̑́█̴̯̀̉ͅ█̵͙͖̀̿█̵͓̰͌█̵̝͉̏█̶̭̅̐█̴̬̱̂ </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/cb16e5f68538ee378cb0b80fea53486d.avif?t=1787708238\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...you doubt? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think this deadly dungeon is a trifling matter? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very well. Try the demo, and <strong>see for yourself</strong>. But: be warned! Those who venture into evil, rarely return... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/9a01d20ba8eeead7b56751c95007a5d5.poster.avif?t=1787708238\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"